cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived version."
type: software
title: "rcmas: Nash Equilibrium Synthesis for Region-Control Multi-Agent Systems"
version: 2.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SJ-Jordaan/rcmas"
authors:
  - family-names: Jordaan
    given-names: Steven
    affiliation: University of Pretoria
abstract: >-
  rcmas synthesises pure Nash equilibria of region-control multi-agent
  systems with the Z3 SMT solver (IBIS, S-IBIS, Q-IBIS and CEGAR-NE, with
  symmetry reduction), and checks every equilibrium it returns with an
  independent certifier. It contains the benchmark territories, the
  configuration and the scripts of the evaluation in Chapter 7 of the PhD
  thesis of Steven Jordaan (University of Pretoria).
keywords:
  - Nash equilibrium
  - strategy synthesis
  - SMT
  - multi-agent systems
  - symmetry reduction
  - abstraction refinement
